    "nyvc_about": {
      "type": "nyvc-about",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "About neOwn",
        "body": "<p>neOwn is India's 1st app-based children's book library operating out of Mumbai, with 15,000+ active subscribers and 25,000+ families served across the country. neOwn currently houses a curated collection of 75,000+ physical books from leading publishers, including Scholastic, HarperCollins, Penguin, Hachette, and many others, that are circulated to kids homes across the country.</p><p>As a holistic initiative to help parents raise confident kids, neOwn offers a Book Library, Toy Library, and a free monthly Reading Challenge accessible to all via the neOwn app. neOwn regularly hosts free book exploration sessions and has conducted 90+ editions in the last 2 years. With a community of parents and a comprehensive ecosystem of reading resources, neOwn is building India's largest platform for encouraging kids to build a reading habit.</p>",
        "cta_text": "Ready to participate? Register above and begin your Young Voices Championship journey.",
        "button_label": "Register here",
        "button_url": ""
      }
    },
